, "seek": 36920, "start": 380.2, "end": 382.2, "text": " You're gonna go fight a dragon and rescue a princess", "tokens": [50914, 509, 434, 799, 352, 2092, 257, 12165, 293, 13283, 257, 14742, 51014], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13035007290073208, "compression_ratio": 1.5732899022801303, "no_speech_prob": 0.004111092537641525}, {"id": 57, "seek": 36920, "start": 382.2, "end": 384.2, "text": " Just so Farquhar to give you back a swamp", "tokens": [51014, 1449, 370, 9067, 358, 5854, 281, 976, 291, 646, 257, 31724, 51114], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13035007290073208, "compression_ratio": 1.5732899022801303, "no_speech_prob": 0.004111092537641525}, {"id": 58, "seek": 36920, "start": 384.2, "end": 387.2, "text": " Which you only don't have because you filled it full of freaks in the first place", "tokens": [51114, 3013, 291, 787, 500, 380, 362, 570, 291, 6412, 309, 1577, 295, 2130, 5461, 294, 264, 700, 1081, 51264], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13035007290073208, "compression_ratio": 1.5732899022801303, "no_speech_prob": 0.004111092537641525}, {"id": 59, "seek": 36920, "start": 387.2, "end": 388.2, "text": " Is that about right?", "tokens": [51264, 1119, 300, 466, 558, 30, 51314], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13035007290073208, "compression_ratio": 1.5732899022801303, "no_speech_prob": 0.004111092537641525}, {"id": 60, "seek": 36920, "start": 388.2, "end": 389.2, "text": " You know what?", "tokens": [51314, 509, 458, 437, 30, 51364], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13035007290073208, "compression_ratio": 1.5732899022801303, "no_speech_prob": 0.004111092537641525}, {"id": 61, "seek": 36920, "start": 389.2, "end": 392.2, "text": " Maybe there's a good reason, donkey shouldn't talk", "tokens": [51364, 2704, 456, 311, 257, 665, 1778, 11, 34834, 4659, 380, 751, 51514], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13035007290073208, "compression_ratio": 1.5732899022801303, "no_speech_prob": 0.004111092537641525}, {"id": 62, "seek": 36920, "start": 392.2, "end": 393.2, "text": " I don't get it Shrek", "tokens": [51514, 286, 500, 380, 483, 309, 1160, 20012, 51564], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13035007290073208, "compression_ratio": 1.5732899022801303, "no_speech_prob": 0.004111092537641525}, {"id": 63, "seek": 36920, "start": 393.2, "end": 395.2, "text": " Why don't you just pull some of that Ogre stuff on him", "tokens": [51564, 1545, 500, 380, 291, 445, 2235, 512, 295, 300, 14883, 265, 1507, 322, 796, 51664], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13035007290073208, "compression_ratio": 1.5732899022801303, "no_speech_prob": 0.004111092537641525}, {"id": 64, "seek": 36920, "start": 395.2, "end": 396.2, "text": " You know, throttle him", "tokens": [51664, 509, 458, 11, 24235, 796, 51714], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13035007290073208, "compression_ratio": 1.5732899022801303, "no_speech_prob": 0.004111092537641525}, {"id": 65, "seek": 36920, "start": 396.2, "end": 397.2, "text": " Lay siege to his fortress", "tokens": [51714, 20084, 34147, 281, 702, 31826, 51764], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13035007290073208, "compression_ratio": 1.5732899022801303, "no_speech_prob": 0.004111092537641525}, {"id": 66, "seek": 39720, "start": 397.2, "end": 399.2, "text": " Grant his bones to make your bread", "tokens": [50364, 17529, 702, 10491, 281, 652, 428, 5961, 50464], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16792452335357666, "compression_ratio": 1.5061728395061729, "no_speech_prob": 0.04253429174423218}, {"id": 67, "seek": 39720, "start": 399.2, "end": 401.2, "text": " You know, the whole Ogre trip", "tokens": [50464, 509, 458, 11, 264, 1379, 14883, 265, 4931, 50564], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16792452335357666, "compression_ratio": 1.5061728395061729, "no_speech_prob": 0.04253429174423218}, {"id": 68, "seek": 39720, "start": 401.2, "end": 403.2, "text": " Oh, and know what?", "tokens": [50564, 876, 11, 293, 458, 437, 30, 50664], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16792452335357666, "compression_ratio": 1.5061728395061729, "no_speech_prob": 0.04253429174423218}, {"id": 69, "seek": 39720, "start": 403.2, "end": 405.2, "text": " Maybe I could have a decapitated entire village", "tokens": [50664, 2704, 286, 727, 362, 257, 368, 9485, 18266, 2302, 7288, 50764], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16792452335357666, "compression_ratio": 1.5061728395061729, "no_speech_prob": 0.04253429174423218}, {"id": 70, "seek": 39720, "start": 405.2, "end": 407.2, "text": " And put their heads on a plight", "tokens": [50764, 400, 829, 641, 8050, 322, 257, 499, 397, 50864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16792452335357666, "compression_ratio": 1.5061728395061729, "no_speech_prob": 0.04253429174423218}, {"id": 71, "seek": 39720, "start": 407.2, "end": 411.2, "text": " Got a knife, cut open their spleen and drink their fluids", "tokens": [50864, 5803, 257, 7976, 11, 1723, 1269, 641, 637, 28238, 293, 2822, 641, 33033, 51064], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16792452335357666, "compression_ratio": 1.5061728395061729, "no_speech_prob": 0.04253429174423218}, {"id": 72, "seek": 39720, "start": 411.2, "end": 413.2, "text": " Does that sound good to you?", "tokens": [51064, 4402, 300, 1626, 665, 281, 291, 30, 51164], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16792452335357666, "compression_ratio": 1.5061728395061729, "no_speech_prob": 0.04253429174423218}, {"id": 73, "seek": 39720, "start": 413.2, "end": 416.2, "text": " Uh, no, not really no", "tokens": [51164, 4019, 11, 572, 11, 406, 534, 572, 51314], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16792452335357666, "compression_ratio": 1.5061728395061729, "no_speech_prob": 0.04253429174423218}, {"id": 74, "seek": 39720, "start": 416.2, "end": 420.2, "text": " For your information, there's a lot more to Ogres than people think", "tokens": [51314, 1171, 428, 1589, 11, 456, 311, 257, 688, 544, 281, 14883, 495, 813, 561, 519, 51514], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16792452335357666, "compression_ratio": 1.5061728395061729, "no_speech_prob": 0.04253429174423218}, {"id": 75, "seek": 39720, "start": 420.2, "end": 421.2, "text": " Like what?", "tokens": [51514, 1743, 437, 30, 51564], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16792452335357666, "compression_ratio": 1.5061728395061729, "no_speech_prob": 0.04253429174423218}, {"id": 76, "seek": 39720, "start": 421.2, "end": 423.2, "text": " Okay, a sample", "tokens": [51564, 1033, 11, 257, 6889, 51664], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.16792452335357666, "compression_ratio": 1.5061728395061729, "no_speech_prob": 0.04253429174423218}, {"id": 77, "seek": 42320, "start": 423.2, "end": 427.2, "text": " Uh, okay, um, Ogres are like onions", "tokens": [50364, 4019, 11, 1392, 11, 1105, 11, 14883, 495, 366, 411, 13146, 50564], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13550397512075063, "compression_ratio": 1.75, "no_speech_prob": 0.0338718444108963}, {"id": 78, "seek": 42320, "start": 428.2, "end": 429.2, "text": " They stink?", "tokens": [50614, 814, 35843, 30, 50664], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13550397512075063, "compression_ratio": 1.75, "no_speech_prob": 0.0338718444108963}, {"id": 79, "seek": 42320, "start": 429.2, "end": 430.2, "text": " Yes, no", "tokens": [50664, 1079, 11, 572, 50714], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13550397512075063, "compression_ratio": 1.75, "no_speech_prob": 0.0338718444108963}, {"id": 80, "seek": 42320, "start": 430.2, "end": 431.2, "text": " Oh, they make you cry", "tokens": [50714, 876, 11, 436, 652, 291, 3305, 50764], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13550397512075063, "compression_ratio": 1.75, "no_speech_prob": 0.0338718444108963}, {"id": 81, "seek": 42320, "start": 431.2, "end": 432.2, "text": " No", "tokens": [50764, 883, 50814], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13550397512075063, "compression_ratio": 1.75, "no_speech_prob": 0.0338718444108963}, {"id": 82, "seek": 42320, "start": 432.2, "end": 435.2, "text": " Oh, you leave them out in the sun, they get all brown, start sprouting little white hair", "tokens": [50814, 876, 11, 291, 1856, 552, 484, 294, 264, 3295, 11, 436, 483, 439, 6292, 11, 722, 6103, 24500, 707, 2418, 2578, 50964], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13550397512075063, "compression_ratio": 1.75, "no_speech_prob": 0.0338718444108963}, {"id": 83, "seek": 42320, "start": 435.2, "end": 436.2, "text": " No!", "tokens": [50964, 883, 0, 51014], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13550397512075063, "compression_ratio": 1.75, "no_speech_prob": 0.0338718444108963}, {"id": 84, "seek": 42320, "start": 436.2, "end": 438.2, "text": " Layers", "tokens": [51014, 20084, 433, 51114], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13550397512075063, "compression_ratio": 1.75, "no_speech_prob": 0.0338718444108963}, {"id": 85, "seek": 42320, "start": 438.2, "end": 441.2, "text": " Onions have layers, Ogres have layers", "tokens": [51114, 1282, 626, 362, 7914, 11, 14883, 495, 362, 7914, 51264], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13550397512075063, "compression_ratio": 1.75, "no_speech_prob": 0.0338718444108963}, {"id": 86, "seek": 42320, "start": 441.2, "end": 443.2, "text": " Onions have layers, did you get it?", "tokens": [51264, 1282, 626, 362, 7914, 11, 630, 291, 483, 309, 30, 51364], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13550397512075063, "compression_ratio": 1.75, "no_speech_prob": 0.0338718444108963}, {"id": 87, "seek": 42320, "start": 443.2, "end": 445.2, "text": " We both have layers", "tokens": [51364, 492, 1293, 362, 7914, 51464], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13550397512075063, "compression_ratio": 1.75, "no_speech_prob": 0.0338718444108963}, {"id": 88, "seek": 42320, "start": 446.2, "end": 449.2, "text": " Oh, okay, yeah, you both have layers", "tokens": [51514, 876, 11, 1392, 11, 1338, 11, 291, 1293, 362, 7914, 51664], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13550397512075063, "compression_ratio": 1.75, "no_speech_prob": 0.0338718444108963}, {"id": 89, "seek": 42320, "start": 449.2, "end": 450.2, "text": " Huh", "tokens": [51664, 8063, 51714], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.13550397512075063, "compression_ratio": 1.75, "no_speech_prob": 0.0338718444108963}, {"id": 90, "seek": 45020, "start": 451.2, "end": 453.2, "text": " You know, not everyone likes onions", "tokens": [50414, 509, 458, 11, 406, 1518, 5902, 13146, 50514], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11861896514892578, "compression_ratio": 1.7058823529411764, "no_speech_prob": 0.009773459285497665}, {"id": 91, "seek": 45020, "start": 453.2, "end": 454.2, "text": " Cake!", "tokens": [50514, 36773, 0, 50564], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11861896514892578, "compression_ratio": 1.7058823529411764, "no_speech_prob": 0.009773459285497665}, {"id": 92, "seek": 45020, "start": 454.2, "end": 456.2, "text": " Cakes have layers, everybody loves cake", "tokens": [50564, 383, 3419, 362, 7914, 11, 2201, 6752, 5908, 50664], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11861896514892578, "compression_ratio": 1.7058823529411764, "no_speech_prob": 0.009773459285497665}, {"id": 93, "seek": 45020, "start": 456.2, "end": 460.2, "text": " I don't care what everyone likes", "tokens": [50664, 286, 500, 380, 1127, 437, 1518, 5902, 50864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11861896514892578, "compression_ratio": 1.7058823529411764, "no_speech_prob": 0.009773459285497665}, {"id": 94, "seek": 45020, "start": 460.2, "end": 464.2, "text": " Ogres are not like cakes", "tokens": [50864, 14883, 495, 366, 406, 411, 19932, 51064], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11861896514892578, "compression_ratio": 1.7058823529411764, "no_speech_prob": 0.009773459285497665}, {"id": 95, "seek": 45020, "start": 466.2, "end": 468.2, "text": " You know what else everybody likes?", "tokens": [51164, 509, 458, 437, 1646, 2201, 5902, 30, 51264], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11861896514892578, "compression_ratio": 1.7058823529411764, "no_speech_prob": 0.009773459285497665}, {"id": 96, "seek": 45020, "start": 468.2, "end": 469.2, "text": " Parfaits", "tokens": [51264, 3457, 69, 1001, 82, 51314], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11861896514892578, "compression_ratio": 1.7058823529411764, "no_speech_prob": 0.009773459285497665}, {"id": 97, "seek": 45020, "start": 469.2, "end": 473.2, "text": " Have you ever met a person you say, hey, let's go get some parfaits and they're like, oh no, I don't like no parfaits", "tokens": [51314, 3560, 291, 1562, 1131, 257, 954, 291, 584, 11, 4177, 11, 718, 311, 352, 483, 512, 36102, 82, 293, 436, 434, 411, 11, 1954, 572, 11, 286, 500, 380, 411, 572, 36102, 82, 51514], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11861896514892578, "compression_ratio": 1.7058823529411764, "no_speech_prob": 0.009773459285497665}, {"id": 98, "seek": 45020, "start": 473.2, "end": 474.2, "text": " Parfaits are delicious", "tokens": [51514, 3457, 69, 1001, 82, 366, 4809, 51564], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11861896514892578, "compression_ratio": 1.7058823529411764, "no_speech_prob": 0.009773459285497665}, {"id": 99, "seek": 45020, "start": 474.2, "end": 475.2, "text": " No!", "tokens": [51564, 883, 0, 51614], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11861896514892578, "compression_ratio": 1.7058823529411764, "no_speech_prob": 0.009773459285497665}, {"id": 100, "seek": 45020, "start": 475.2, "end": 478.2, "text": " You dense, irritating miniature beast of burden", "tokens": [51614, 509, 18011, 11, 45971, 34674, 13464, 295, 12578, 51764], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11861896514892578, "compression_ratio": 1.7058823529411764, "no_speech_prob": 0.009773459285497665}, {"id": 101, "seek": 47820, "start": 478.2, "end": 480.2, "text": " Ogres are like onions", "tokens": [50364, 14883, 495, 366, 411, 13146, 50464], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.10598657131195069, "compression_ratio": 1.4331550802139037, "no_speech_prob": 0.005183387082070112}, {"id": 102, "seek": 47820, "start": 480.2, "end": 482.2, "text": " End of story, bye-bye", "tokens": [50464, 6967, 295, 1657, 11, 6543, 12, 6